hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1596","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Laila bin Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Sahl se, unhon ne Sahl bin Abi Hathma se riwayat kya ke unhein un ki qoum ke badon mein se kuchh mardon ne khabar di ke Abdullah bin Sahl aur Muhayyisa aik takleef ki wajah se Khaibar ki taraf nikle jo unhein pahunchi thi, phir Muhayyisa ke paas aaya gaya aur khabar di gai ke Abdullah bin Sahl qatal kar diye gae hain aur kunwein ya chashme ke kinare mein phenk diye gae hain, to wo yahood ke paas aae aur kaha ke Allah ki qasam tum hi ne use qatal kya hai. Unhon ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam hum ne use qatal nahi kya. Phir wo aae yahan tak ke apni qoum ke paas pahunche aur unhein ye baat batayi, phir wo aae aur un ke bhai Huwayyisa jo un se bade they aur Abdur Rahman, phir Muhayyisa bolne ke liye aage badhe jo Khaibar mein they to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se kaha ke bade ko, bade ko muqaddam karo, Aap umr ka irada karte they, phir Huwayyisa bole phir Muhayyisa bole. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ya to tumhare sathi ki deet dein ya jang ka elaan sun lein. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is bare mein unhein likha to unhon ne likha ke hum ne Allah ki qasam use qatal nahi kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Huwayyisa aur Muhayyisa aur Abdur Rahman se farmaya ke kya tum qasam khaoge aur apne sathi ke khoon ke mustahiq banoge. Unhon ne kaha ke nahi. Aap ne farmaya ke kya yahood tumhare liye qasam khain ge. Unhon ne kaha ke wo musalman nahi hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni taraf se us ki deet di aur unhein sau oontniyan bhejin yahan tak ke ghar mein dakhil kar di gain. Sahl ne kaha ke un mein se aik surkh oontni ne mujhe thokar mari."
"1597","Malik ne kaha ke mukatab ke bare mein jo behtreen baat maine suni hai wo ye hai ke jo shakhs ko aisa zakhm lagata hai jis mein aql lazim aati hai ke agar mukatab is zakhm ki deet apni kitabat ke sath ada karne ki taqat rakhta hai to use ada kare aur apni kitabat par rahe, phir agar wo is ki taqat na rakhe to wo apni kitabat se aajiz aa gaya, aur ye is liye ke use is zakhm ki deet kitabat se pehle ada karni chahiye, phir agar wo is zakhm ki deet ada karne se aajiz aa jaye to us ke aaqa ko ikhtiyar diya jaye, phir agar wo chahe ke is zakhm ki deet ada kare to kare aur apne ghulam ko roke aur wo ghulam mamlook ho jaye, aur agar chahe ke ghulam ko zakhmi ke hawale kar de to use hawale kar de, aur aaqa par apne ghulam ko hawale karne se zyada kuchh lazim nahi."
